# <%= title %>

<% if layout == :full -%>
A [DragonRuby](https://dragonruby.org) game.
<% else -%>
A [DragonRuby](https://dragonruby.org) library.
<% end -%>

## Setup

<% if commit_engine? -%>
The DragonRuby engine (<%= engine.version %> <%= engine.tier %>) is committed with the project.
<% else -%>
The project pins DragonRuby <%= engine.version %> (<%= engine.tier %>) in `.dragonruby-version`; the engine itself isn't committed. Install it with [talon](https://github.com/asimmons91/dr_talon):

```bash
talon engine import path/to/dragonruby-<%= engine.tier %>-<%= engine.platform %>.zip   # once per machine
talon engine use
```
<% end -%>

Editor tooling (RuboCop, Solargraph):

```bash
bundle install
```

## Running

```bash
<% if layout == :full -%>
talon run      # ./dragonruby mygame
talon test     # *_tests.rb in mygame/tests/
talon build    # package every platform into builds/
talon serve    # play the HTML5 build at http://localhost:8080/
<% else -%>
talon run      # ./dragonruby .
talon test     # ./dragonruby . --test for each test/*_tests.rb
<% end -%>
```
